      "_doc": "Owner order 2026-11-25. Step 1: the list of every action the Claude Code safety classifier or permission layer stopped in this fleet (base). Step 2: each is declared in three forms (gh REST short flag, gh REST long flag, gh CLI / native CLI) = 3x. Step 3: every form is emitted bare and with a trailing wildcard = doubled. scope: vm = expanded over matrix.vms, repo = over matrix.repos, once = emitted once.",
